        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The charts below show the figure for work hours per week in the industrial sector in four European countries in 2002. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FhS4dfcEXoX5RSxsirsl0TFkg6b\"><em><strong>The charts below show the figure for work hours per week in the industrial sector in four European countries in 2002. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"Uqpqdj1GJoEkqlxj1aYlgWErguh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Working hours per week in four European countries: 2002</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BYDmdTmrLovqhQx0Ps7lf6Hkg1b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i <em>Working hours per week in four European countries: 2002</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ phần trăm người lao động trong ng&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nghiệp theo số giờ l&agrave;m việc mỗi tuần ở 4 quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u trong năm 2002.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVREdkcdDoiuwixGVrXlEimng9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2KUdr10HoS97zxVv0ilC6U1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung: </strong>Paraphrase đề <em>Working hours per week in four European countries: 2002</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: số giờ l&agrave;m việc mỗi tuần - người lao động trong ng&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nghiệp - 4 quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u - năm 2002</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SAQxdgsL6o1FJYx9eUwlYqvBgge\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQn8dU3IToFrThxBuZOlJ4Sdg5c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Difference</strong>s: Số giờ l&agrave;m việc phổ biến nhất ở 3/4 quốc gia l&agrave; 36-40 giờ/tuần, trong đ&oacute; Sweden c&oacute; tỷ lệ cao nhất. Trong khi đ&oacute;, France l&agrave; quốc gia duy nhất c&oacute; đa số người lao động l&agrave;m việc 31-35 giờ/tuần.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPj5dnUApovegdx2UfilgPTbgon\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Main features:</strong> The UK c&oacute; tỷ lệ c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m th&ecirc;m giờ cao nhất trong 4 quốc gia (46-50 v&agrave; 50+ giờ).</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KYM4ddF3Nod0xmxPUhulWaqjg3d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KmJidCEtvoXsooxfg0nlI3RngZd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Denmark &amp; Sweden</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKdhdanzMoMn9mxzY1klspUcgne\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFNNdYzgHoQTvaxwNOglyfCdg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Denmark v&agrave; Sweden ở mức cao nhất </strong><em>(tỷ lệ c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m việc 36-40 tiếng mỗi tuần ở Denmark v&agrave; Sweden lần lượt l&agrave; 70% v&agrave; 80%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T9avdFadqoF6fjx8TZZlCkoWgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu c&aacute;c mức giờ kh&aacute;c của Denmark&nbsp;</strong><em>(tỷ lệ c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m việc 31-35 tiếng mỗi tuần cao thứ nh&igrave;, chiếm 22%, trong khi c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m giờ c&ograve;n lại dao động khoảng 10% mỗi nh&oacute;m)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T9avdFadqoF6fjx8TZZlCkoWgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu c&aacute;c mức giờ kh&aacute;c của Sweden&nbsp;</strong><em>(tỷ lệ nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n l&agrave;m việc với số giờ kh&aacute;c nhau ph&acirc;n bổ rộng hơn, với 36% c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m từ 31-35 giờ v&agrave; 29% c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m từ 41-45 giờ mỗi tuần)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HdJgd2k5roDDvnxYToJlHaRBgCb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rs1QdpGB7oSzzExe0VAlKiasg9e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> France &amp; The UK</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5dqd9nO1oWdKUxywl5l0bYggpe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSFd3IqjoDLLsxA7FRlubh5g7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của France </strong><em>(khoảng 1 nửa số lượng c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m việc từ 31-35 tiếng, v&agrave; 36% số lượng c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m từ 36-40 tiếng&nbsp;mỗi tuần. Đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute;, tỷ lệ c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m việc từ 46-50 giờ mỗi tuần l&agrave; 20%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MJtcdJdxOoSVTuxaTzolXTpdgce\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của The UK </strong><em>(tỷ lệ c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m việc từ 36-40 tiếng 1 tuần l&agrave; cao nhất, khoảng 48%, The UK cũng l&agrave; nước c&oacute; nhiều c&ocirc;ng nh&acirc;n l&agrave;m việc trong khoảng 46-50 tiếng v&agrave; hơn 50 tiếng mỗi tuần nhất, với tỷ lệ lần lượt l&agrave; 19% v&agrave; 21%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KVX2dj2hXoaQicxXXS6licq4gdf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BMU6dhTL1o1FbTx3FwjlVZU7g6g\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>số giờ l&agrave;m việc mỗi tuần</strong>\", thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>work hours per week</strong>\", ta c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng một số những cụm sau để c&oacute; thể đa dạng c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">weekly working hours</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9G5dxbOfoTmDRxOKw9loDfygsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">worked <strong>[number] </strong>hours weekly</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HiBjdYruDodZggxuWQhlhVengvd\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sq5TdyINToHWzoxG2iJlBtvog3b\" data-list=\"bullet\">The bar charts compare the <strong>weekly working hours </strong>of employees in the industrial sector across four European nations, namely France, Denmark, Sweden, and the UK, in 2002.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2YEdFskSoqGJNxP3tclj0AzgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Interestingly, 20% of workers in France also <strong>worked 46-50 hours weekly.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<di